<title>USA: Morgan Q3 profit despite higher charge.</title>
<headline>Morgan Q3 profit despite higher charge.</headline>
<dateline>WILLIAMSBURG, Va. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Products Ltd said it saw increased restructuring charges related to the consolidation of manufacturing operations, but it still expected to report a profit in the third quarter.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the restructuring charges, to be taken in the third and fourth quarters, would total between $2.6 million and $3 million. The company previously estimated charges would total around $1.6 million.</p>
</text>
